@startuml figure_deployment
title 图 医院预约与体质辨识系统 — 部署图

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei UI"
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  BorderColor #37474F
}

left to right direction

actor "用户" as User

node "客户端设备\n«device»" as Device {
  artifact "Web 浏览器" as Browser
}

cloud "公网 / 机构网络" as Net {
  node "接入层\n«execution environment»" as Edge {
    artifact "Nginx\n(HTTPS / 反向代理 / 静态资源)" as Nginx
  }

  node "应用服务器\n«execution environment»" as AppNode {
    artifact "hospital-frontend\n(Vue 3 构建产物)" as FEBuild
    artifact "hospital-appointment-system\n(Spring Boot / JVM)" as BootJar
  }

  node "AI 推理服务器\n«execution environment»" as AiNode {
    artifact "ai-service\n(Flask + ONNX Runtime)" as FlaskApp
  }

  node "数据与中间件\n«device»" as DataNode {
    database "MySQL 8.0" as MySQL
    artifact "Redis" as Redis
    artifact "RabbitMQ" as MQ
    artifact "Nacos" as Nacos
  }
}

cloud "外部云服务" as Ext {
  artifact "DeepSeek API" as DeepSeek
  artifact "对象存储 OSS\n(可选)" as OSS
}

User --> Browser : HTTPS
Browser --> Nginx : 443
Nginx --> FEBuild : 静态站点
Nginx --> BootJar : /api 等\n反向代理
Browser ..> BootJar : WebSocket\n(可经 Nginx)

BootJar --> MySQL : JDBC
BootJar --> Redis : 缓存 / 锁
BootJar --> MQ : AMQP
BootJar --> Nacos : 配置拉取
BootJar --> FlaskApp : HTTP\n舌象检测
BootJar --> DeepSeek : HTTPS
BootJar ..> OSS : SDK\n(若启用)

FlaskApp ..> DeepSeek : 可选\n编排调用
FlaskApp ..> MySQL : 可选\n日志 / 任务

@enduml
